<main class="" id="main-content" style="max-width: 860px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 2rem 1rem;">
  <div class="reveal" style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">
    <h1 style="font-size: 2.2rem; color: var(--dct-charcoal); margin-bottom: 1rem;">Privacy Notice — Spice & Sail Zanzibar</h1>
    <p style="color: var(--dct-text-muted); font-size: 1.1rem;">Data Controller: Spice and Sail Zanzibar, a Zanzibar-based tour operator registered with the Zanzibar Commission for Tourism (ZCT). Excursions, transfers and charters are delivered with licensed partners.</p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">
    <h2 style="font-size: 1.5rem; color: var(--dct-ocean); margin-bottom: 1rem;">What Personal Data We Collect</h2>
    <p style="color: var(--dct-text-muted); line-height: 1.8;">When you interact with our concierge widget, website forms, or WhatsApp chat, we may collect the following categories of data:</p>

    <dl style="margin: 2rem 0; max-width: 700px;">
      <dt>Contact Information</dt>
      <dd>Name, WhatsApp number (E.164 format), and/or email address — provided voluntarily when submitting an enquiry, quote request, or lead form.</dd>

      <dt>Trip Details</dt>
      <dd>Services interested in, travel dates, party size (adults/children), pickup location/hotel, and special requests/notes — provided voluntarily when using the concierge widget or quote calculator.</dd>

      <dt>Consent Status</dt>
      <dd>Whether you have ticked "Contact me about this request" and/or "Send me marketing information".</dd>

      <dt>Technical Data</dt>
      <dd>IP address, browser type, device type, approximate geographical location (country-level only), pages visited on our site, referral source, and timestamp of visit — collected automatically via standard web server logs and Cloudflare Analytics.</dd>
    </dl>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">
    <h2 style="font-size: 1.5rem; color: var(--dct-ocean); margin-bottom: 1rem;">Lawful Basis and Compliance</h2>
    <p style="color: var(--dct-text-muted); line-height: 1.8;">As a Zanzibar-based tourism operator, we process personal data under the following legal frameworks:</p>
    <ul style="color: var(--dct-text-muted); line-height: 1.8; margin: 0;">
      <li><strong>General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR):</strong> Legitimate interest and contract performance basis for handling enquiries, bookings, and operational communications. Data Controller is Spice and Sail Zanzibar, a Zanzibar-based tour operator registered with the Zanzibar Commission for Tourism (ZCT).</li>
      <li><strong>Zanzibar Tourism Act No. 6 of 2009:</strong> statutory requirements for ZIC (Zanzibar Inbound Travel Insurance) registration, ZRB levy collection, and visitor registration norms.</li>
      <li><strong>Tanzanian Data Protection Laws:</strong> compliance with the Data Protection (General) Regulations, 2023, as they apply to foreign-inbound tourism operators.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">
    <h2 style="font-size: 1.5rem; color: var(--dct-ocean); margin-bottom: 1rem;">Who We Share Data With</h2>
    <ul style="color: var(--dct-text-muted); line-height: 1.8; margin: 0;">
      <li>Cloudflare KV (production) — encrypted at-rest, used as the persistent store for leads and references. Access limited to server-side functions. Data may be stored in Cloudflare's EU/US data centre region.</li>
      <li>Internal operations alert channels used by our reservations desk (WhatsApp, email, Discord, or Slack). No data is sent to channels that are not configured.</li>
      <li>Law enforcement or regulatory authorities — only where required by applicable law or court order.</li>
      <li>With your consent (if you tick "Send me marketing information") — only to send you promotional emails about Zanzibar travel offers, if an email address is provided.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">
    <h2 style="font-size: 1.5rem; color: var(--dct-ocean); margin-bottom: 1rem;">Data Retention</h2>
    <p style="color: var(--dct-text-muted); line-height: 1.8;">We retain lead data for a maximum of 3 years from the date of creation, unless you request deletion earlier. Consent preferences and technical logs are retained for 12 months. Anonymous usage analytics are retained per Cloudflare's privacy policy. Children's data (under 16) is retained for a maximum of 2 years.</p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">
    <h2 style="font-size: 1.5rem; color: var(--dct-ocean); margin-bottom: 1rem;">Children's Data Protection</h2>
    <p style="color: var(--dct-text-muted); line-height: 1.8;">We do not knowingly collect personal data from children under the age of 16. If you are a parent or guardian and believe we have inadvertently collected data from a child, please email <a href="mailto:{{ site.contact.email }}"><strong>{{ site.contact.email }}</strong></a> and we will erase it immediately. Our services are not directed to children, and we do not knowingly collect personal data from anyone under 16.</p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">
    <h2 style="font-size: 1.5rem; color: var(--dct-ocean); margin-bottom: 1rem;">Your Rights</h2>
    <p style="color: var(--dct-text-muted); line-height: 1.8;">You have the right to:</p>
    <ul style="color: var(--dct-text-muted); line-height: 1.8; margin: 0 0 1rem 1.5rem;">
      <li>Request access to the personal data we hold about you — email <strong>{{ site.contact.email }}</strong> with a description of the data you seek.</li>
      <li>Request correction of inaccurate personal data.</li>
      <li>Request deletion of your personal data — email <strong>{{ site.contact.email }}</strong> with your reference (SP-YYYY-NNNNNN) and we will erase it within 30 days.</li>
      <li>Withdraw consent at any time — untick "Contact me about this request" or "Send me marketing information" in the concierge widget.</li>
      <li>Object to processing of your personal data for marketing purposes.</li>
      <li>Request data portability — receive your data in a structured, commonly used format.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div style="border-top: 1px solid var(--dct-divider); padding-top: 2rem;">
    <h2 style="font-size: 1.5rem; color: var(--dct-ocean); margin-bottom: 1rem;">Contact</h2>
    <p style="color: var(--dct-text-muted); line-height: 1.8;">If you have questions about this privacy notice, exercise any of your rights, or wish to request data deletion, please email <a href="mailto:{{ site.contact.email }}" style="color: var(--dct-ocean);"><strong>{{ site.contact.email }}</strong></a>.</p>
    <p style="color: var(--dct-text-muted); margin-top: 1rem; font-size: 0.9rem;">This notice was last updated on 2026-11-21.</p>
  </div>
</main>

